output/
*.sqlite
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/*.png

# Datasets are simulated at runtime by the workspace simulator scripts, which the
# example scripts invoke automatically when the dataset is missing (the
# `__Dataset Auto-Simulation__` guards). Everything under `dataset/` is therefore
# ignored. The only committed exceptions are the five hand-made overview media
# illustrations, which no simulator writes; their allowlist lives in
# `dataset/.gitignore` (the deeper file wins for paths under `dataset/`) and is
# mirrored here for clarity.
dataset/**
!dataset/.gitignore
!dataset/overview/
!dataset/overview/ccd.gif
!dataset/overview/ccd_schematic.png
!dataset/overview/cti.gif
!dataset/overview/cti_time_evolution.png
!dataset/overview/what_is_cti.png
